Establish the core parametric CAD architecture.

This milestone delivers the foundational systems that all higher-level CAD functionality depends upon:

- Data Model
- Rebuild Engine
- Topological Naming
- Rebuild-Safe References
- Geometry Kernel Wrapper

Successful completion means CADalytic can:

- Create and manage a document hierarchy
- Maintain feature dependencies
- Perform deterministic rebuilds
- Preserve model references across rebuilds
- Isolate OCCT behind a geometry abstraction layer

This milestone deliberately excludes:

- Sketching
- Feature modelling
- User interface work
- Assemblies
- CAM
- Plugins

Focus is on correctness, maintainability and architectural foundations.

